# The S3 campaign directory is 304 MB on disk. Keep the same audit subset the
# accepted S2 bundle keeps -- the IDF actually run, its expanded form, and the
# EnergyPlus diagnostic files -- and leave out the bulk outputs (eplusout.sql
# ~105 MB, eplusout.csv ~72 MB, eplusout.eso ~90 MB), which are reproducible
# from the retained IDF and the pinned EPW whose SHA-256 is in the manifest.
#
# Whitelist, not a blacklist: a new EnergyPlus output type must be added here
# deliberately rather than arriving in the repository by default.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.idf
!*.expidf
!*.err
!*.end
!*.eio
!*_f000_gain.csv
